{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "145", "x": 0.8949472934591233, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.03879595514451251, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Anyway, I remember it was about maybe 2 months ago, we were hanging out at a", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.12319506908974809, "w": 0.8259682225956181, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "cafe on a weekend, and one of my friends brought it up because he had read an", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.15152541916388573, "w": 0.8268583442445515, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "article online saying that some companies in China had already started using Al", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.17970752416545568, "w": 0.8260333259412842, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "teachers in classrooms, which he thought was amazing. We took a lot of interest", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2080378742395933, "w": 0.826033428466238, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "in the topic, because a few of us are working in education or tech.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.23636822431373095, "w": 0.6673810349135402, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "So, that was how the discussion began. Some of us thought it was a great idea.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2930660423122369, "w": 0.8262408364477851, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "You know, more efficient, cost-effective, and Al never gets tired. But others were", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.32139637352567824, "w": 0.8263104508914186, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "a bit worried, saying that it could take away the human touch in teaching, and", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3497267990426009, "w": 0.8259682225956181, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "might lead to job losses. I was personally kind of in the middle. I mean, for me, Al", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3780571491167385, "w": 0.8262832817786603, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "can be helpful, but it shouldn't fully replace real people, especially in jobs that", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.40638753691226864, "w": 0.8258594436196312, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "need empathy and communication.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4347178869864063, "w": 0.3588914971237137, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Anyway, that day we ended up talking for almost two hours because everyone was", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.49140337008956114, "w": 0.8261207797268797, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "so engaged and had a lot to say. Since it's a topic that could affect all of us in the", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5197337201636988, "w": 0.8264018006252587, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "near future, it naturally led to such a long and meaningful discussion. Although", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5480641079592289, "w": 0.8260335309911918, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "we didn't exactly agree on everything, it was a really intriguing conversation that", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5763944580333665, "w": 0.8259899578858247, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "gave us plenty of food for thought.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6047248458288966, "w": 0.3572789333877946, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "p3", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6612743433120499, "w": 0.032736961055793774, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "1.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6896046933861876, "w": 0.020609553398225476, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Well, I think these days most people in China find out about news mainly", "x": 0.16774843308549978, "y": 0.6896046933861876, "w": 0.7655569314404356, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "through digital platforms, like smartphones. I mean, if you open an app like", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7179351189031102, "w": 0.8260550612314908, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "WeChat or Weibo, you can immediately see what's happening, because these apps", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7462654689772478, "w": 0.8261643528322468, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "constantly update you with breaking news and trending topics. Short-video", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7745958190513854, "w": 0.826786679301842, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "platforms like Douyin, which you might know as TikTok, are also very popular for", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8029261691255231, "w": 0.8259898553608709, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "catching up on news, especially among younger people. But of course, if you're", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8312565191996607, "w": 0.8260117957009852, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "older, you might still prefer traditional ways, like watching TV. You know, channels", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8596116899500704, "w": 0.8264376843590904, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "like CCTV news are still really common in homes, and a lot of older folks rely on", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8879420400242081, "w": 0.8259682225956181, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "these for daily news updates.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.9162723900983457, "w": 0.30245125374177634, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}